# Schema ledger for FOLLOWER (backlog JF, split per device by NY.1). Checked by tests/test_state_ledger.cpp, whose banner says what each
# difference means: a new line is pasted, a harmless change is refreshed (FEATHERS_LEDGER_WRITE=1), a MEANING change is a new key or a schema bump.
device FOLLOWER - schema=2
param FOLLOWER mode unit=choice choice=Control|Audio
param FOLLOWER input unit=percent min=-1 max=1 stepped=0
param FOLLOWER detector unit=choice choice=Peak|RMS|Signed
param FOLLOWER attack unit=log_seconds min=-13.287712379549449 max=0 stepped=0
param FOLLOWER release unit=log_seconds min=-9.965784284662087 max=2.321928094887362 stepped=0
param FOLLOWER gain unit=decibel min=-24 max=24 stepped=0
param FOLLOWER floor unit=decibel min=-72 max=0 stepped=0
param FOLLOWER threshold unit=percent min=0 max=1 stepped=0
param FOLLOWER poly unit=choice choice=Off|On
param FOLLOWER enabled unit=choice choice=Off|On
out FOLLOWER env bipolar=1
out FOLLOWER trig bipolar=0
retired FOLLOWER source 2026-10-26 the Sidechain source is gone: the sidechain enters the chain at a Sidechain Inject device and a Follower in Audio mode after it follows it
